  "invariants": [
    "The measurement mode is exactly endpoint_scoped_conservative_measurement.",
    "Tenant-wide SharePoint baseline, request allowance and resource-unit allowance are explicitly NOT_CLAIMED.",
    "The fixed plan dispatches exactly 500 synthetic GETs as 1, 1, 90 at 10 seconds, 120 at 60 seconds and 288 at 300 seconds.",
    "Concurrency is exactly one, the global rate never exceeds six dispatches per minute and catch-up bursts are forbidden.",
    "The static full-run projection is exactly 30000 GB-s and observed app-wide delta plus projected remaining execution never exceeds 120000 GB-s.",
    "Azure Monitor values are app-wide deltas and are never represented as endpoint attribution or tenant-wide SharePoint capacity.",
    "Azure Monitor uses only the fixed ARM metrics endpoint, five fixed metrics, Total, PT1M, no dimension filter, UTC minute-aligned bounded windows and a 300-second settlement delay.",
    "Every Azure Monitor metric requires exactly one dimensionless app-wide Total series per partition and unknown response fields fail closed.",
    "The final settled Azure Monitor window starts at the owner-bound anchor, covers through measurement_finished_at_utc and is observed only after its end plus at least 300 seconds.",
    "The final Azure Monitor observation contains at least 500 OnDemandFunctionExecutionCount executions before PASSED is possible.",
    "A valid early FAILED measurement requires only its actual dispatched attempt count in the final Monitor observation and still finalizes evidence after durably releasing the lease.",
    "Every pre-dispatch safety observation records projected_remaining_execution_units_gb_seconds computed from the bound remaining dispatch count plus at most 30 unsettled dispatches; only the outer completion evidence after final settlement requires it to be exactly zero.",
    "The lease broker exposes only acquire(-1), assert_held and release for one dedicated state blob that it may conditionally create once.",
    "The lease state machine is ACQUIRE_INTENT, ACQUIRE_IN_FLIGHT, HELD, RELEASE_INTENT, RELEASED and terminal LOST; PASSED is possible only after RELEASED is durable.",
    "The final release receipt proves the exact RELEASED state and matching target and lease bindings; a lifecycle-state hash alone is insufficient.",
    "Crash or resume requires the same run, target and lease binding; an exact same-ticket retry or a fresh owner-signed same-run ticket may reconcile an existing intent while retaining its persisted broker-private lease ID, and a lost or foreign lease blocks without dispatch.",
    "Lease break, delete and reacquire after a confirmed held, lost or released state are forbidden; only bounded intent reconciliation may repeat an acquire after an authoritative NOT_PRESENT probe, and the broker may conditionally create the exact absent state blob once.",
    "The broker conditionally creates the exact zero-byte state blob with If-None-Match:* and performs a strong ETag readback; overwrite and delete are forbidden.",
    "The Blob token scope is exactly https://storage.azure.com/.default.",
    "A first deployment persists the immutable original nameAvailable=true receipt before mutation and the exact successful deployment receipt afterward; complete retries use zero name probes and zero deployment creates, validate a fresh GET of the same deterministic deployment, then repeat fresh safety readbacks.",
    "A name-only retry may return to the fresh path only after a new current nameAvailable=true probe; unavailable names and running, failed, missing, replaced, incomplete, tampered, or mismatched deployment evidence block without redeployment based on history alone.",
    "Effective RBAC and ABAC are expanded and checked at subscription, resource-group, storage-account, blob-service and container scopes; exactly one expected assignment and no broader data assignment are allowed.",
    "One combined offline owner gate binds commit, tree, toolchain, activation, contract, phase, measurement, monitor, lease, bootstrap and infrastructure inputs.",
    "The exact owner gate binds approved commit, tree, toolchain, contract, phase plan, measurement policy, monitor, lease and infrastructure hashes.",
    "The owner gate binds a whole-minute UTC monitor window anchor and all deterministic inputs are remeasured before the first lease or monitor network call.",
    "The owner gate binds the exact tenant, subscription, resource group, deployment mode, location and nonempty tags instead of accepting a caller-selected Azure scope.",
    "Any owner-gate binding drift blocks before network dispatch.",
    "The runtime accepts only a BoundPerformanceAuthorizationVerifier and its verified authority; an arbitrary preflight callable or caller-supplied binding cannot authorize live work.",
    "Authority issuance requires the concrete sealed AzurePerformanceInfrastructureSafetyVerification provenance, not a caller-fabricated mapping or an unkeyed transcript hash.",
    "Every Blob operation, Monitor read and target GET requires the exact owner-bound action, target and adapter binding with bounded non-replayable use before token, network or state access.",
    "Monitor-read authorization is capped at 2048 uses per issued capability and is consumed before token or network access independently from the durable 500-target-GET ledger.",
    "Target bindings are reverified immediately before each target dispatch, source bindings are remeasured at execution, and the sealed Azure CLI toolchain is remeasured immediately before every subprocess.",
    "After token acquisition the endpoint binding is reverified and the request is constructed only from the captured approved endpoint.",
    "The final monitor attestation and execution-unit cap are revalidated before release and bound into final evidence.",
    "A post-release crash resumes from the exact pending-finalization record without lease reacquire, monitor reread or target dispatch.",
    "A nonblocking local process fence covers the complete measurement and finalization lifecycle for one state path; a concurrent process blocks before owner verification or network.",
    "Every redacted terminal measurement is durable before the final Monitor read; a Monitor failure retains the terminal checkpoint and held lease, and retry repeats only the final Monitor read.",
    "Every validated terminal measurement is represented by a durable pending-finalization record before release; same-ID release reconciliation is crash-safe and the record is cleared only after JSON and Markdown evidence are durable.",
    "Every early cleanup release is preceded by an atomic release-recovery checkpoint; after process restart that checkpoint is reconciled before any acquire and is cleared only after an exact RELEASED receipt.",
    "A completed final-evidence record is returned only after fresh owner and infrastructure-safety verification; its readback performs no lease, Monitor, or target network action.",
    "Final redacted JSON and Markdown evidence are committed only by a completion manifest written last and binding both artifact hashes and the final-evidence hash after the lease is durably RELEASED.",
    "The pinned Bicep compiler and structural ARM validator run in CI for the coordination template.",
    "The owner-gated live CLI and bound production composition are implemented offline; this contract slice executes no resource mutation, Blob or lease call, Monitor read, or target dispatch.",
    "Evidence is aggregate-only and redacted and repeats the NOT_CLAIMED tenant-wide SharePoint position."
  ],
